------------------------------------------------------------------------
What is your assessment of the assignment? Was it helpful? Was it fun?

It was a little confusing at first just because of the length of the assignment description. However, it was really 
fun figuring out the how to use a DFA, and it was fun doing some problem solving. However, I think debugging was the 
hardest and more tiring part of the process. I was always trying to think of a more efficient way to write things, 
however, I sometimes just couldn't think of one myself. Overall, I think it was a pretty fun assignment!

